      "statement": "The npm scripts are dev/start (astro dev), build (astro build to ./build), test (node --no-warnings --test \"tests/*.test.mjs\" — the Node built-in runner over ALL sixteen tests/*.test.mjs regression guards in one invocation), lint (prettier --check . && eslint .), format (prettier --write .), and protogen (protoc + ts-proto regenerating src/proto/message.ts). The Zero Factory precommit hook's default/all path runs format (npx prettier --write . + npx eslint . --fix), then build (npx tsc --noEmit + npm run build), then test (npm test — all sixteen guards).",
